neath."},{"parts":[],"joints":[9,10],"note":"Screw one half of each slide to the carcass, the other to the drawer side, and slide the drawer in."},{"parts":[[{"idx":6,"version":3},{"idx":12,"version":1}]],"note":"Screw the front on from inside the box, 2 mm clear all round, and fit the handle."}],"explode":0.0}}}